# CODEOWNERS — default fallback for any repo without its own CODEOWNERS file.
#
# Syntax: <pattern> <owner1> <owner2>
# Owners listed here are auto-requested as reviewers when a PR touches matching files.
# More specific patterns override less specific ones; the LAST matching line wins.

# Default owner for everything
*                      @Jigen-lab/engineering

# Security-sensitive paths require security team review
/SECURITY.md           @Jigen-lab/security
/.github/              @Jigen-lab/security @Jigen-lab/engineering
**/security/           @Jigen-lab/security
**/auth/               @Jigen-lab/security
**/Dockerfile*         @Jigen-lab/security
**/*.tf                @Jigen-lab/security
**/*.tfvars            @Jigen-lab/security

# CI/CD changes
/.github/workflows/    @Jigen-lab/engineering @Jigen-lab/security
